        "note": "Anthropic's Lean 4 formalization of the paper of Alman and Vassilevska Williams (Apache-2.0), written for Lean and Mathlib v4.33.1 and not maintained. The 340 of its Lean files that this project imports are included in upstream/3sum-apsp/, at the pinned commit, and ported to Lean and Mathlib v4.35.0-rc2 (the registry's floor): the port changes only what no longer compiles, in four files, and no statement or definition; each changed file is marked in its header and listed in upstream/README.md, and scripts/check-upstream.sh confirms that every other file is upstream's, byte for byte. It supplies the trusted file EndStatement.lean (the word RAM, Problem.SolvedInTime and the four problems; unchanged, and its 132 lines of Lean are copied verbatim into ImprovedChallenge.lean, which imports nothing, and scripts/check-endstatement.sh confirms the copy), the programs of the paper, their proofs, and the lemmas that this project reuses by name. Several files of ImprovedExponents/ adapt upstream developments for parameters or bounds that upstream fixes; NOTICE lists them.",
